 "final_text": "The theorem in `/work/fateh_017.lean` is now proved, and the file compiles with `lean /work/fateh_017.lean` with no errors and no `sorry` warning.\n\nThe proof goes through the cyclotomic polynomial \u03a6\u209a:\n\n1. **Identify the quotient with \u03a6\u209a.** Since \u03a6\u209a \u00b7 (X \u2212 1) = X^p \u2212 1 and X \u2212 1 is monic, dividing by X \u2212 1 gives back \u03a6\u209a over \u2124.\n2. **Transfer irreducibility to \u211a.** \u03a6\u209a is primitive over \u2124, so by Gauss's lemma it is irreducible over \u2124 exactly when its image over \u211a is irreducible.\n3. **Apply Mathlib's result.** The image of \u03a6\u209a over \u211a is `cyclotomic p \u211a`, which is irreducible for p > 0 by `cyclotomic.irreducible_rat`.\n\nI only replaced the `sorry`; the imports, the statement and the docstring are unchanged.",
